1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,291
Caspion was a small silver fish who loved
to swim faster and farther than all

2
00:00:11,291 --> 00:00:12,190
the others.

3
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:18,060
Come on, everybody! Let's
see what's beyond the reef!

4
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:25,250
But his friends were afraid to leave
the reef, so Caspion set out alone.

5
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:29,850
Far from home, Caspion
heard someone crying.

6
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:36,560
Why are you crying, little whale?

7
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:42,550
I lost my mother in the
storm... I'm all alone.

8
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:49,440
Don't worry. I'll help you find her!

9
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:10,010
Well, well... a snack and a dessert.

10
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:15,240
Help!

11
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:18,760
Leave those little ones alone!

12
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,760
Mama! You found me!

13
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:32,220
This is Caspion. He helped me!

14
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:36,220
Thank you, brave little fish.

15
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:46,490
So you want to see the world
above the water, little fish?

16
00:01:46,490 --> 00:01:49,630
More than anything!

17
00:01:51,630 --> 00:01:57,600
Then my friend the jellyfish will carry
you, with a little sea inside her bell.

18
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:17,730
And so Caspion rose up, up, up... until
he saw the sky for the very first time.

19
00:02:33,730 --> 00:02:38,640
The world is simply
wonderful... wet or dry!

20
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:41,640
העולם פשוט נפלא, רטוב או יבש!

